31503-The form:input-required attribute specifies whether a control that is bound to a database field requires user input for the form to submit.
31504-
31505-The attribute is not evaluated for a control that is not bound to a database field vi form:data-field 19.263, or that has the form:convert-empty-to-null 19.259 attribute evaluate to "false".
31506-
31507-The defined values for the form:input-required attribute are:
31508-
31509-•false: a control that has no user input does not prevent submission of the form. 
31510-
31511-•true: a control that has no user input does prevent submission of the form.  
31512-
31513-The default value for this attribute is false.
31514-
